= Malenyevist-wing members split

Our policy choices have greatly offended the Malenyevists, and many of their leaders have split to form a new party, the CPS, or the Communist Party of Sordland. They do not count a huge section of our membership, so this should be survivable.

[? if social_democrat_resign = 1 : Many former Social Democrat's have joined with the CPS, the party formed by dissident malenyevist's. They have brought their support base and organization skills to the party, leading to its growth as a nascent rival to the PFJP for the support of the working class. ?]

